usage: c2-controls-r43.py [-h] --root ROOT --out OUT --json-out JSON_OUT
                          [--receipts RECEIPTS] [--ctl CTL] [--build]
                          [--counter COUNTER] [--generator GENERATOR]
                          [--interp INTERP] [--eval EVAL] [--dev DEV]
                          [--r42-dev R42_DEV] [--r42-controls R42_CONTROLS]
                          [--r42-receipt R42_RECEIPT]
                          [--r42-heldout R42_HELDOUT]
                          [--evidence-dir EVIDENCE_DIR] --freeze FREEZE
                          [--scratch SCRATCH]

R43-C1 controls: build the round-43 control tables and score every control.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           lane root
  --out OUT             control table directory
  --json-out JSON_OUT   summary receipt
  --receipts RECEIPTS   per-control receipt directory (default:
                        <out>/receipts)
  --ctl CTL             comma separated control ids to run (default: all)
  --build               build the control tables (the controls themselves copy
                        the frozen round-42 documents byte-exact)
  --counter COUNTER     the round-43 counter (default:
                        tools/round-43/c1-counter.py)
  --generator GENERATOR
                        the round-43 generator (default:
                        tools/round-43/heldout-gen-v4r43.py)
  --interp INTERP       the frozen interpreter (default: tools/round-42/sqfs-
                        triage-v4.py)
  --eval EVAL           the frozen evaluator (default: tools/round-42/indep-
                        eval-v4.py)
  --dev DEV             the frozen dev arm (default:
                        corpus/evidence/round-42/c2/dev)
  --r42-dev R42_DEV
  --r42-controls R42_CONTROLS
  --r42-receipt R42_RECEIPT
  --r42-heldout R42_HELDOUT
  --evidence-dir EVIDENCE_DIR
                        the evidence path the counter reads and the control
                        plants into
  --freeze FREEZE       the freeze commit the controls are scored against
  --scratch SCRATCH     scratch directory (default: a temporary directory
                        under TMPDIR)
